# U42: the tab's undo/redo (Draw's KeyDown loop: Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y -> UndoHandler with
# ConfigTab:CreateUndoState / RestoreUndoState -> UpdateControls, BuildModList) after an option
# change ("Are you always moving?", whose callback runs AddUndoState): undo restores the loaded
# input (ResetUndo ran after the loaded Config section), redo the change; a second undo past the
# first state does nothing. Ctrl+F focuses the search box (typing filters the options), and the
# unsaved marker follows the tab's modFlag (ResetModFlags is not run: the title keeps the `*`).
#! u42-expect-config boolean="true" name="conditionMoving"
#! u42-expect-absent boolean="true" name="conditionMoving"
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press 5
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 573 254
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot moving
move 900 600
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot undone
key-down CTRL
press y
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot redone
key-down CTRL
press z
press z
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot undone_twice
key-down CTRL
press f
key-up CTRL
type "boss"
frames 3
